@* Worth stating on the surface itself rather than only in the spec: this
   product has permanently declined to judge whether a trade is fair to the
   other manager. Somebody will ask for that feature the first time they open
   this page, and the answer should be here when they do. *@
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="trade-scope">
    <h2 id="trade-scope">What this will not do</h2>
    <p>
        It will not tell you whether a trade is fair to the other manager. That
        needs a model of their roster needs, which does not exist here and would
        not be honest to guess at — a verdict computed without one is
        authoritative-looking noise. This is a permanent scope decision, not a
        missing feature.
    </p>
</section>
